 "name_en": "Accounting and Financial Close (J58)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Accounting and Financial Close (J58)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The central task of general ledger accounting is providing a comprehensive overview of external accounting and accounts. By recording all business transactions, including primary postings and settlements from internal accounting, in a system that is fully integrated with all the other operational areas of a company, you ensure accuracy and completeness for accounting data.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">General Ledger Accounting serves as a complete record of all business transactions providing a centralized, up-to-date reference for the rendering of accounts. Actual individual transactions are reviewed with real-time processing, displaying the original documents, line items, and transaction figures at various levels (such as account information, journals, totals, transaction figures, and balance sheets).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process describes all required period end-closing steps, related to performing local period-end closing and steps that are identical for local and parallel ledger.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Post general ledger account documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display the document journal</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display G/L balances (list)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform recurring entries</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain accounts with automatic and manual clearing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform day-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform month-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform year-end closing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Recording all business transactions ensures complete and accurate accounting data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>会计和财务关账 (J58)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">总账会计的中央任务是提供外部会计和科目的全面概览。通过与公司所有其他运营范围完全集成的系统中记录所有业务交易（包括来自内部会计的初级过账和结算），可确保会计数据的准确性和完整性。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">总账会计用作所有业务交易的完整记录，为呈现科目提供集中、最新的参考。通过实时处理检查实际的单个交易，显示不同级别的原始凭证、行项目和交易额（例如科目信息、日记账、总计、交易额和资产负债表）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程描述了与执行本地期末关账相关的所有必需期末关账步骤，以及本地和并行分类账中相同的步骤。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">过账总账科目凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示凭证日记账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示总账余额（清单）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行周期性分录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过自动和手动清账维护科目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行日结账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行月末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行年终关账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio668253f1ad5149e69b467a87b6771f9a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">记录所有业务交易，确保完整、准确的会计数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
